WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.720
Now, if you know the books,

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:02.640
chances are you know

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.600
the "Dear Friend" letters

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.080
between Yennefer and Geralt.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.320
They are a moment of comedy

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.600
that really sums up

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.920
all the dysfunction
of the relationship.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.280
They're very 
funny but

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.680
not very romantic.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.120
We don't see the letters in Season 2,

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:16.200
but we do get a nice nod toward them.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.120
Let us take a look.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.760
Geralt, do you know
what to do with this?

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.040
-Sorry.
-Ciri.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.040
Sorry.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:23.920
This is my...

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.400
You're so good in this.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.120
...dear friend.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.960
"Dear friend."

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.240
This is Yennefer.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.240
You're Yennefer.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.560
And you must be his...

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.960
Child Surprise.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:46.920
Oh, you're so mean.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.880
Yeah, to be fair, you don't 
really have much right

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.920
-to be pissed off.
-Exactly.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:54.880
You're... yeah, you're about
to try and kill my kid.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:56.720
What did you call me?

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:00.800
Anya, Henry, and Freya,
in the books,

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.200
your characters have this
very tricky relationship,

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.160
as we saw,
and in the show it's the same.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.080
Anya, you want
to sacrifice his kid,

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.000
you hold a knife
to her throat.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.080
Like, how do you think
they feel about...

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.920
-Happy family!
-Exactly.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.280
-Yeah.
-Saturday night in my house.

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:17.840
It's just like Monopoly, right?

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.360
Yeah, exactly.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.520
How do you feel, like,
they feel about each other

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:24.440
at the end of the season?

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:26.920
-It's.. I mean...
-I don't know.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.920
-It's tricky.
-It's a tricky one.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:32.240
I mean, it's a fairly extreme
set of circumstances

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:34.920
to come back from.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.800
I think we're... yeah,

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.120
we're gonna have
to play with that

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.440
-a little bit.
-I think we'll have

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.920
to figure that out
in Season 3, to be honest.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.720
It's I mean,
it's pretty extreme,

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:46.160
so it's a tough one
to forgive.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:48.120
It's gonna take
some real work

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.800
and some nuance
and some complexity...

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:52.560
All right, okay,
I've gotta work.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.520
Yeah. So, Anya,

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.920
where do you see
your character going

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:58.320
in Season 3 and beyond?

00:01:58.320 --> 00:01:59.640
It's habitual, isn't it?

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:00.920
She's how old,

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.680
and she's lived
the kind of life she's lived,

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:04.760
and, you know, the rules
that she lives by,

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:05.960
and that's Yen,

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.360
and she doesn't trust nobody,

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:10.400
and it's gonna be hard
to just delve into

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.360
a new way of being.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.080
There are certain...

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:17.000
she might have learned
to consider things more,

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.080
but in the moment,

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:20.720
in such a kind of
violent world,

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.640
you know,
you've kind of just gotta

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:24.280
look out for yourself as well.

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:25.960
So, I don't know,
it's gonna be difficult.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:29.800
I think whatever happens with
the storytelling in Season 3,

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:31.240
Anya's gonna knock it
out of the park.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:35.480
She is extraordinary with
what she does with Yennefer.

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:38.760
The subtlety in her performance
is mind-blowing.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:41.960
Like, you are top-notch.

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:43.000
Like what you see?

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.560
Be sure to check out
the full episode

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.760
of The Witcher: Unlocked,

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:48.400
the official Netflix Geeked
aftershow.

